# Keep the build context to what `go build` actually reads: go.mod, go.sum,
# cmd/, internal/, proto/. Everything below either bloats the context or
# invalidates layer caches on changes that cannot affect the binaries.
bin/
coverage/
data/
docs/
.github/
test/
.git/
*.md
.env
compose*.yaml
deploy/
# ui/ itself IS part of the context now -- the node stage compiles it -- but
# node_modules is hundreds of megabytes that the stage reinstalls from the
# lockfile anyway.
ui/node_modules/
